  "_factions": "The dialect. roles say what each mount role is allowed to carry and what it carries by default, which is where a Kthaari cruiser stops being a Terran one with different paint. budget_scale and base_load_scale move the four budgets; base_load_scale is applied on top of the class fraction, so a culture that berths more marines eats its own room rather than everybody's. system_scale multiplies box counts by code, and a scale of 0 removes the system from that culture entirely. names are ten per culture, in ladder order.",
